<title>USA: Houston Ship Channel closed due to capsized barge.</title>
<headline>Houston Ship Channel closed due to capsized barge.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Houston Ship Channel was closed Thursday due to a capsized barge, an official at the Galveston Ship Pilots told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;From what I understand, they closed it because of a capsized barge,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>He did not know when the channel was shut, when the barge capsized or what it was carrying, if anything.</p>
<p>((-- Oliver Ludwig New York Energy Desk +1 212 859 1633))</p>
